==English==

===Etymology===
Used in Raymond Chandler's ''Farewell, My Lovely'' (1940), suggesting the red colour of a sunset.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|US|noir|rare}} A [[fatal]] [[wound]] caused by a [[knife]] fight.
